{
  "name": "Pinecone 雲端向量資料庫與 AI 檢索 (RAG)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🌲 範例 6：Pinecone 雲端向量資料庫與 AI 檢索\n\n1. **🆓 永久免費 Starter 方案**：免綁信用卡，建立 Serverless 向量索引。\n2. **Chat Trigger**：提供智慧對話視窗。\n3. **AI Agent**：結合 Pinecone 向量檢索工具的智慧核心。\n4. **Pinecone Vector Store**：連接雲端專用向量資料庫（毫秒級向量搜尋）。\n5. **Embeddings 模型**：支援 OpenAI (1536維) 或免費 Google Gemini (768維)。",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 500
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -220,
        100
      ],
      "id": "pinecone-note",
      "name": "流程說明"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chatTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        400
      ],
      "id": "chat-trigger-pinecone",
      "name": "When chat message received"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "你是一位專業的雲端知識庫顧問。請使用繁體中文回答使用者問題，回答必須嚴格依據從 Pinecone 向量資料庫中檢索到的文件內容。若知識庫查無相關資料，請禮貌告知「目前知識庫中查無此相關資料」。"
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        100,
        400
      ],
      "id": "pinecone-rag-agent",
      "name": "Pinecone RAG 智慧問答代理"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -80,
        640
